{"id":"ksba-config.1","n":"ksba-config","s":"1","src":{"u":{"pkg":"libksba-dev","ver":"1.6.0-2ubuntu0.2","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/libk/libksba/libksba-dev_1.6.0-2ubuntu0.2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/ksba-config.1.gz","sha256":"054e7365862ebc60572dcc7c697a5dd08497b53bddbea705b94e3a0290a8acdf","date":"December 5, 2001","origin":"libksba"}},"nopt":{"u":5},"desc":"print libksba library configuration information","u":[["NAME","<p>ksba-config - print libksba library configuration information</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>ksba-config</b> [--prefix] [--exec-prefix] [--version] [--libs] [--cflags]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>This prints out various configuration information for the ksba library. It is useful for application building and packaging procedures.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><i>--version</i></dt><dd>Show version number.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><i>--prefix</i></dt><dd>Outputs the prefix used to install libksba.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><i>--exec-prefix</i></dt><dd>Outputs the exec-prefix used to install libksba.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><i>--cflags</i></dt><dd>Outputs include flags for the C compiler.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><i>--libs</i></dt><dd>Outputs library flags for the linker.</dd></dl>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Matthias Urlichs &lt;smurf@debian.org&gt;</p>"]]}